<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="th">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover" />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#0c7c73" />
  <title>ระบบบันทึกทบทวนคุณภาพ 13 กิจกรรม | งานกายภาพบำบัด รพ.เขื่องใน</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Sarabun:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <script>
    // ฝังลิงก์ Web App ของคุณเรียบร้อยแล้ว
    const DEFAULT_GAS_WEB_APP_URL = "https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbz7NW_7qvBuZvKMahW3gj6YhJP8lohMi0DSkMjk3inIzJQi9vdKTROZHwIklBZhL7_t/exec";
  </script>
  <style>
    :root {
      --primary:#0c7c73; --primary-dark:#0a5c56; --primary-soft:#e7f6f4;
      --accent:#0369a1; --accent-light:#e0f2fe;
      --warning:#b45309; --warning-light:#fef3c7;
      --success:#15703a; --success-light:#dcfce7;
      --danger:#b42318; --danger-light:#fee4e2;
      --slate-50:#f3f6f5; --slate-100:#e8eeec; --slate-200:#dbe3e1;
      --slate-300:#c5d0cd; --slate-500:#5e726d; --slate-600:#3e524e;
      --slate-700:#243632; --slate-800:#16302c; --slate-900:#0d1f1c;
      --radius:16px;
      --shadow-sm:0 1px 2px rgba(13,31,28,.06), 0 8px 24px rgba(13,31,28,.04);
      --topbar-h:64px;
      --bottom-nav-h:64px;
      --safe-t:env(safe-area-inset-top, 0px);
      --safe-b:env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px);
    }
    * { box-sizing:border-box; }
    html { -webkit-text-size-adjust:100%; }
    body {
      margin:0;
      font-family:'Sarabun',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;
      background:
        radial-gradient(1200px 500px at 100% -10%, rgba(12,124,115,.08), transparent 50%),
        var(--slate-50);
      color:var(--slate-800);
      line-height:1.55;
      font-size:15px;
    }
    button, input, select, textarea { font-family:inherit; }
    :focus-visible { outline:2px solid var(--primary); outline-offset:2px; }
    ::selection { background:#b7e4df; }

    .topbar {
      background:rgba(10,92,86,.94);
      color:#fff;
      padding:10px 16px;
      padding-top:calc(10px + var(--safe-t));
      position:sticky; top:0; z-index:120;
      backdrop-filter:saturate(1.2) blur(10px);
      display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; gap:10px;
      box-shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.08);
    }
    .brand { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; min-width:0; }
    .brand-icon {
      width:40px; height:40px; border-radius:12px; flex:0 0 auto;
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.14);
      display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
      font-weight:700; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.22);
    }
    .brand-text { min-width:0; }
    .brand-text h1 { font-size:16px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:-.01em; margin:0; }
    .brand-text p { font-size:12px; opacity:.86; margin:0; white-space:nowrap; overflow:hidden; text-overflow:ellipsis; }
    .topbar-controls { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:center; gap:8px; }
    .period-selector {
      display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px;
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.12);
      padding:4px 8px; border-radius:999px;
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16);
    }
    .period-selector label { font-size:12.5px; font-weight:600; }
    .period-selector select {
      background:#fff; color:var(--slate-900); border:none;
      padding:6px 8px; border-radius:999px;
      font-size:13.5px; font-weight:600; cursor:pointer;
    }

    .menu-toggle {
      display:none; width:42px; height:42px; border-radius:12px; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.28);
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.12); padding:0; cursor:pointer;
      flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:5px; flex:0 0 auto;
    }
    .menu-toggle span { display:block; width:18px; height:2px; border-radius:2px; background:#fff; }

    .btn {
      display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:6px;
      min-height:40px; padding:8px 14px; border-radius:999px;
      font-size:13.5px; font-weight:600; border:1px solid transparent;
      cursor:pointer; transition:transform .12s ease, background .12s ease, opacity .12s ease;
      white-space:nowrap;
    }
    .btn:hover { transform:translateY(-1px); }
    .btn:active { transform:translateY(0); }
    .btn:disabled { opacity:.55; cursor:not-allowed; transform:none; }
    .btn-primary { background:var(--primary); color:#fff; }
    .btn-primary:hover { background:var(--primary-dark); }
    .btn-accent { background:var(--accent); color:#fff; }
    .btn-success { background:var(--success); color:#fff; }
    .btn-warning { background:var(--warning); color:#fff; }
    .btn-danger { background:var(--danger); color:#fff; }
    .btn-outline { background:#fff; color:var(--slate-700); border-color:var(--slate-300); }
    .btn-outline:hover { background:var(--slate-100); }
    .btn-glass { background:rgba(255,255,255,.14); color:#fff; border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.22); }
    .btn-glass:hover { background:rgba(255,255,255,.24); }
    .btn-sm { min-height:34px; padding:4px 10px; font-size:12.5px; }

    .app-container { display:block; min-height:calc(100dvh - var(--topbar-h)); }
    .sidebar {
      position:fixed; z-index:300; top:0; left:0; bottom:0;
      width:min(88vw, 340px);
      background:#fff;
      padding:16px;
      padding-top:calc(16px + var(--safe-t));
      padding-bottom:calc(16px + var(--bottom-nav-h) + var(--safe-b));
      display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:12px;
      transform:translateX(-105%);
      transition:transform .28s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1);
      overflow:auto;
      border-right:1px solid var(--slate-200);
    }
    .sidebar.open { transform:translateX(0); box-shadow:16px 0 48px rgba(13,31,28,.18); }
    .drawer-head { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:8px; }
    .drawer-head strong { font-size:15px; }
    .drawer-backdrop {
      display:none; position:fixed; inset:0; z-index:250;
      background:rgba(13,31,28,.45); backdrop-filter:blur(2px);
    }
    .drawer-backdrop.show { display:block; }
    body.drawer-open { overflow:hidden; }

    .filter-box { background:var(--slate-50); border:1px solid var(--slate-200); border-radius:14px; padding:12px; }
    .filter-box label { display:block; font-size:12.5px; font-weight:700; color:var(--slate-600); margin-bottom:6px; }
    .filter-box select, .form-group input, .form-group select {
      width:100%; padding:10px 12px; border:1px solid var(--slate-300); border-radius:12px;
      font-size:16px; background:#fff; color:var(--slate-900);
    }
    .nav-list { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:6px; overflow:auto; padding-right:2px; }
    .nav-item {
      display:flex; align-items:flex-start; justify-content:space-between; gap:8px;
      padding:12px; border-radius:14px; border:1px solid transparent;
      cursor:pointer; text-align:left; background:transparent; width:100%; min-height:44px;
    }
    .nav-item:hover { background:var(--slate-100); }
    .nav-item.active { background:var(--primary-soft); border-color:#9ad8d1; }
    .nav-item-left { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:2px; min-width:0; }
    .nav-item-title { font-size:13.5px; font-weight:650; color:var(--slate-800); line-height:1.35; }
    .nav-item.active .nav-item-title { color:var(--primary-dark); }
    .nav-item-owner { font-size:11.5px; color:var(--slate-500); }

    .badge { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:999px; font-size:11px; font-weight:700; white-space:nowrap; }
    .badge-done { background:var(--success-light); color:var(--success); }
    .badge-progress { background:var(--warning-light); color:var(--warning); }
    .badge-todo { background:var(--slate-200); color:var(--slate-600); }
    .badge-fail { background:var(--danger-light); color:var(--danger); }
    .badge-owner { background:var(--accent-light); color:var(--accent); font-size:12px; padding:3px 10px; }

    .main-content {
      padding:16px 14px calc(24px + var(--bottom-nav-h) + var(--safe-b));
      max-width:1360px; width:100%; margin:0 auto;
    }
    .stats-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(150px,1fr)); gap:12px; margin-bottom:16px; }
    .stat-card {
      background:#fff; border-radius:var(--radius); padding:16px 16px 14px;
      border:1px solid var(--slate-200); box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm);
      display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:4px;
      border-top:3px solid var(--primary);
    }
    .stat-label { font-size:12.5px; color:var(--slate-500); font-weight:700; }
    .stat-value { font-size:26px; font-weight:750; letter-spacing:-.03em; color:var(--slate-900); line-height:1.15; }
    .stat-sub { font-size:12px; color:var(--slate-500); }

    .card { background:#fff; border-radius:var(--radius); border:1px solid var(--slate-200); box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm); margin-bottom:16px; overflow:hidden; }
    .card-header { padding:14px 16px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--slate-200); display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; gap:10px; }
    .card-header h2 { font-size:16px; font-weight:750; margin:0; }
    .card-body { padding:14px; }
    .table-responsive {
      width:100%; overflow-x:auto; border:1px solid var(--slate-200); border-radius:12px;
      -webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;
      background:
        linear-gradient(90deg,#fff 30%,rgba(255,255,255,0)),
        linear-gradient(270deg,#fff 30%,rgba(255,255,255,0)) 100% 0,
        radial-gradient(farthest-side at 0 50%, rgba(13,31,28,.16), transparent),
        radial-gradient(farthest-side at 100% 50%, rgba(13,31,28,.16), transparent) 100% 0;
      background-repeat:no-repeat;
      background-size:36px 100%, 36px 100%, 12px 100%, 12px 100%;
      background-attachment:local, local, scroll, scroll;
    }
    table.data-table { width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; font-size:13.5px; background:#fff; }
    table.data-table th, table.data-table td { padding:8px; border:1px solid var(--slate-200); vertical-align:top; text-align:left; }
    table.data-table th { background:#f7faf9; font-weight:750; white-space:nowrap; position:sticky; top:0; z-index:1; }
    table.data-table input[type="text"],
    table.data-table input[type="number"],
    table.data-table input[type="date"],
    table.data-table select,
    table.data-table textarea {
      width:100%; padding:8px 10px; border:1px solid var(--slate-300); border-radius:10px;
      font-size:16px; background:#fff; color:var(--slate-900);
    }
    table.data-table textarea { resize:vertical; min-height:64px; }
    table.data-table input:focus, table.data-table select:focus, table.data-table textarea:focus { outline:2px solid var(--primary); border-color:transparent; }

    .form-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(200px,1fr)); gap:12px; margin-bottom:16px; }
    .form-group { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:5px; }
    .form-group label { font-size:13px; font-weight:700; color:var(--slate-700); }
    .activity-banner {
      background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f3fbfa,#eef6fb);
      border:1px solid #c9ebe6; border-radius:var(--radius);
      padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px;
      display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; justify-content:space-between; align-items:flex-start; gap:12px;
    }
    .activity-banner-info h2 { font-size:18px; font-weight:750; margin:0 0 4px; letter-spacing:-.02em; }
    .activity-banner-info p { font-size:13.5px; color:var(--slate-600); margin:0; }
    .export-toolbar, .export-toolbar-left, .export-toolbar-right { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:8px; align-items:center; }
    .export-toolbar {
      background:#fff; padding:10px 12px; border-radius:14px;
      border:1px solid var(--slate-200); margin-bottom:14px; justify-content:space-between;
    }
    .helper-banner { background:#fffbeb; border:1px solid #fde68a; color:#92400e; padding:10px 12px; border-radius:12px; font-size:13px; margin-bottom:14px; }
    .sub-tabs { display:flex; gap:8px; margin-bottom:14px; overflow-x:auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch; padding-bottom:4px; }
    .sub-tab { flex:0 0 auto; padding:8px 14px; border-radius:999px; border:1px solid var(--slate-300); background:#fff; font-size:13px; font-weight:700; cursor:pointer; color:var(--slate-700); min-height:40px; }
    .sub-tab.active { background:var(--primary); color:#fff; border-color:var(--primary); }

    .modal-backdrop { position:fixed; inset:0; background:rgba(13,31,28,.5); display:none; align-items:flex-end; justify-content:center; z-index:400; padding:0; }
    .modal-backdrop.open { display:flex; }
    .modal-content {
      background:#fff; width:100%; max-width:820px; max-height:92dvh; overflow:auto;
      border-radius:20px 20px 0 0;
      padding-bottom:var(--safe-b);
      box-shadow:0 -12px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.18);
    }
    .modal-header { padding:14px 16px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--slate-200); display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; gap:8px; position:sticky; top:0; background:#fff; z-index:1; }
    .modal-header h3 { margin:0; }
    .modal-body { padding:16px; }
    .toast {
      position:fixed; left:12px; right:12px;
      bottom:calc(12px + var(--bottom-nav-h) + var(--safe-b));
      background:var(--slate-900); color:#fff;
      padding:12px 14px; border-radius:14px;
      font-size:13.5px; font-weight:650; z-index:450;
      opacity:0; transform:translateY(8px); transition:all .2s ease; pointer-events:none; max-width:min(520px, 90vw);
    }
    .toast.show { opacity:1; transform:translateY(0); }

    .date-picker-wrap { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:4px; min-width:138px; }
    .date-picker-wrap input[type="date"] { padding:6px 8px; border:1px solid var(--primary); border-radius:10px; background:var(--primary-soft); color:var(--primary-dark); font-size:16px; font-weight:650; width:100%; }
    .thai-date-display { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:4px; font-size:12px; color:var(--slate-700); background:#fff; border:1px solid var(--slate-300); border-radius:8px; padding:4px 6px; }
    .btn-clear-date { background:var(--slate-200); border:none; border-radius:6px; min-width:28px; min-height:28px; cursor:pointer; color:var(--slate-700); font-weight:700; }
    body.readonly-mode #mainContentArea input[readonly],
    body.readonly-mode #mainContentArea textarea[readonly] { background:var(--slate-50); border-color:var(--slate-200); }
    #readonlyNotice {
      background:#fffbeb; border:1px solid #fde68a; color:#92400e;
      padding:10px 12px; border-radius:12px; font-size:13.5px; margin-bottom:12px;
      display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; gap:10px; flex-wrap:wrap;
    }
    #printArea { display:none; }

    .bottom-nav {
      position:fixed; left:0; right:0; bottom:0; z-index:180;
      display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.94);
      backdrop-filter:blur(12px);
      border-top:1px solid var(--slate-200);
      padding:6px 6px calc(6px + var(--safe-b));
    }
    .bottom-nav button {
      appearance:none; border:0; background:transparent; color:var(--slate-500);
      display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:2px;
      min-height:48px; border-radius:12px; font-size:11px; font-weight:700; cursor:pointer;
    }
    .bottom-nav svg { width:22px; height:22px; stroke:currentColor; fill:none; stroke-width:1.8; stroke-linecap:round; stroke-linejoin:round; }
    .bottom-nav button.active { color:var(--primary-dark); background:var(--primary-soft); }
    body.drawer-open .bottom-nav button[data-view="menu"] { color:var(--primary-dark); background:var(--primary-soft); }

    @media (max-width:1099px) {
      .menu-toggle { display:inline-flex; }
      .brand-text p { display:none; }
      .brand-text h1 { font-size:14.5px; }
      .topbar-controls {
        width:100%; flex-wrap:nowrap; overflow-x:auto;
        -webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch; scrollbar-width:none; padding-bottom:2px;
      }
      .topbar-controls::-webkit-scrollbar { display:none; }
      .sidebar .btn, .export-toolbar .btn, .activity-banner .btn { min-height:42px; }
    }
    @media (min-width:1100px) {
      .app-container { display:grid; grid-template-columns:300px 1fr; }
      .sidebar {
        position:sticky; top:calc(64px + var(--safe-t));
        height:calc(100dvh - 64px - var(--safe-t));
        width:auto; transform:none; box-shadow:none;
        padding-bottom:16px; z-index:1;
      }
      .drawer-head, .drawer-backdrop, .bottom-nav, .menu-toggle { display:none !important; }
      .main-content { padding:24px 24px 32px; }
      .nav-list { max-height:calc(100dvh - 340px); }
      .modal-backdrop { align-items:center; padding:24px; }
      .modal-content { border-radius:18px; max-height:88dvh; }
      .toast { left:auto; right:20px; width:min(480px, 40vw); bottom:20px; }
      .stats-grid { grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr); }
    }
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce) {
      *, *::before, *::after { transition:none !important; }
    }
    @media print {
      body * { visibility:hidden; }
      .topbar, .sidebar, .main-content, .modal-backdrop, .toast, .bottom-nav, .drawer-backdrop, .menu-toggle { display:none !important; }
      #printArea, #printArea * { visibility:visible; }
      #printArea { display:block !important; position:absolute; left:0; top:0; width:100%; background:#fff; color:#000; font-family:'Sarabun','TH SarabunPSK',sans-serif; font-size:13pt; }
      #printArea table { width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; margin-top:8pt; margin-bottom:12pt; }
      #printArea th, #printArea td { border:1px solid #000; padding:5pt 6pt; font-size:11.5pt; text-align:left; vertical-align:top; }
      #printArea th { background:#f1f5f9 !important; -webkit-print-color-adjust:exact; print-color-adjust:exact; font-weight:700; }
      #printArea .sign-table td { border:none !important; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="topbar">
    <button type="button" class="menu-toggle" id="menuToggle" onclick="toggleDrawer()" aria-label="เปิดเมนู">
      <span></span><span></span><span></span>
    </button>
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="brand-icon">PT</div>
      <div class="brand-text">
        <h1>ระบบบันทึกและทบทวนคุณภาพ 13 กิจกรรม (HA)</h1>
        <p>งานกายภาพบำบัด กลุ่มงานเวชกรรมฟื้นฟู โรงพยาบาลเขื่องใน จ.อุบลราชธานี</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="topbar-controls">
      <div class="period-selector">
        <label for="selectMonth">เดือน / ปีงบประมาณ:</label>
        <select id="selectMonth" onchange="onPeriodChange()"></select>
        <select id="selectYear" onchange="onPeriodChange()"></select>
      </div>
      <button class="btn btn-glass" id="pinModeBtn" onclick="openPinModal()">👀 โหมดดูอย่างเดียว (กดเพื่อแก้ไข)</button>
      <button class="btn btn-glass" onclick="openCloudModal()">☁️ เชื่อมต่อ Google Sheets</button>
      <button class="btn btn-glass" onclick="exportAllBackupJSON()">💾 สำรองข้อมูล (.json)</button>
      <label class="btn btn-glass" id="importLabel" style="cursor:pointer;">
        📂 นำเข้าไฟล์ข้อมูล
        <input type="file" accept=".json" style="display:none" onchange="importBackupJSON(event)" />
      </label>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="drawer-backdrop" id="drawerBackdrop" onclick="closeDrawer()"></div>

  <div class="app-container">
    <aside class="sidebar">
      <div class="drawer-head">
        <strong>กิจกรรม</strong>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm" onclick="closeDrawer()">ปิด</button>
      </div>
      <button class="btn btn-primary" style="width:100%; justify-content:flex-start;" onclick="selectView('dashboard')">📊 หน้าแรก Dashboard ติดตามงาน</button>
      <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:6px;">
        <button class="btn btn-accent btn-sm" style="padding:8px 6px;" onclick="selectView('sar')">📈 สรุปรายปี (SAR)</button>
        <button class="btn btn-outline btn-sm" style="padding:8px 6px;" onclick="selectView('search')">🔍 ค้นหาย้อนหลัง</button>
      </div>
      <div class="filter-box">
        <label for="ownerFilter">👤 กรองตามผู้รับผิดชอบ:</label>
        <select id="ownerFilter" onchange="onOwnerFilterChange()">
          <option value="ALL">แสดงทั้งหมด (13 กิจกรรม)</option>
          <option value="กภ.กิตติ สมบรรดา">กภ.กิตติ สมบรรดา (4 เรื่อง)</option>
